category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libgtest-devel
sdesc: "Fast Common Data Representation (CDR) Serialization Library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "eProsima Fast CDR is a C++ library that provides two serialization mechanisms.
One is the standard CDR serialization mechanism, while the other is a faster
implementation that modifies the standard."
